    "games.k": "Ten games, one world", "games.h": "Choose your game", "games.lead": "Every game lives in the Game Village. Walk in through its door, or open the Games list — your hero, your wallet and your ARCL come with you.", "games.also": "Also in town: the hoverboard race, the weekly raid boss, 5 near and 7 far hunting grounds, and ARCIRCLE LAND.",
    "heroes.k": "Characters", "heroes.h": "Three heroes. Your pick.", "heroes.lead": "Pick one, give it your colour and a name. All three grow the same way — level 1 to 500, gear in seven slots — and each brings its own style into SURVIVORS ARENA.",
